Evaluation data (not included in this repository)

eval/replay_aidev.py measures Itemator's rules on the AIDev dataset:
  Hao Li, Haoxiang Zhang, Ahmed E. Hassan, "AIDev" dataset, version v3,
  https://huggingface.co/datasets/hao-li/AIDev
  Licence: CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/)
  Paper: arXiv 2507.15003

The script fetches the data at run time into data/, which is gitignored.
The dataset is not redistributed here. results/replay_predictions.json holds
values derived from it (pull request and issue URLs, file paths, package and
symbol names, counts); this notice is its attribution.

The changed files of each sampled pull request come from the GitHub REST API
at run time and are cached in eval/cache/, which is also gitignored. Each
source repository keeps its own copyright and licence.
